SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 0.05

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1-2
    Calcite 0 0

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

USE solution 1
USE equilibrium_phases 1
USE mix 1
USE reaction_temperature 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -temperature true
    -pH true
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
    -high_precision true

END
